        "We are the first to show the potential of using LLMs to assess the quality of texts and discuss the limitations and ethical considerations of LLM evaluation.\n",
        "\\end{abstract}\n",
        "\\section{Introduction}\n",
        "Human evaluation is an important method to understand the performance of an NLP model or algorithm~\\citep{guzman-etal-2015-humans, gillick-liu-2010-non}.\n",
        "We rely on human evaluation because there are certain aspects of texts that are hard to evaluate using automatic evaluation metrics; thus, researchers resort to humans to rate the quality of the output of NLP models.\n",
